==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sun & Moon|Brionne|40}} from the {{TCG|Sun & Moon}} expansion; both cards have the Wave Splash attack.
*'''Wave Splash''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Vending|Golduck|S3}} from {{TCG|Expansion Sheet 3}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

